// Carrying a wizard-owned item authorizes a gift, without changing ownership.
@nonprogrammer
@wizard
; move(#45, #90103); move(#47, #90103); return {#47.owner, #45:acceptable(#47)};
{#2, true}
@nonprogrammer
% get #47
~~You picked up the Architect's Compass.
% give #47 at #45
~~You give the Architect's Compass to Mr. Welcome.
@quiet
@wizard
; return {#47.location, #47.owner};
{#45, #2}
~~RUNTIME_PLAYER picked up the Architect's Compass.
~~RUNTIME_PLAYER gives the Architect's Compass to Mr. Welcome.
// The command also works for a wizard, using the natural-language preposition.
; move(#47, #90100); return true;
true
% hand #47 to #45
~~You give the Architect's Compass to Mr. Welcome.
; return {#47.location, #47.owner};
{#45, #2}
